#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:1
#: ad6bc82c53014545a5a56e0131cd5134
msgid "13. C Runtime Framework"
msgstr "13. C 运行时框架"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:5
#: 5eea6b5d7fb54a7cb35cc874e2f13a49
msgid ""
"FreeSWITCH is a **C realtime communications switch that ships its own "
"runtime**, not a typical “sockets plus `malloc`” C program. The "
"`switch_*` APIs, memory pools, sessions, channels, modules, events, "
"queues, and threads are that runtime. APR (forked here as **FSPR**) is "
"only the portable OS layer underneath it."
msgstr ""
"可以把 FreeSWITCH 理解成一个**用 C 写的、自己构建了一套运行时框架的高性能实时通信系统**。`switch_*` "
"API、memory pool、session、channel、module、event、queue、thread "
"组成了这套运行时。APR（本树中的 fork 为 **FSPR**）只是其下的可移植 OS 层。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:7
#: e188d0bb1361417796e5e21cfa9310d9
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This page is a reading model for the C core. C4 containers and the "
"session state machine stay on [Architecture](01-architecture.md). "
"Operator terms stay in the [Users Manual Chapter "
"1](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/foundations/introduction)."
" Directory ownership stays on [Repository Map](03-repo-map.md)."
msgstr ""
"本页是阅读 C 核心的心智模型。C4 容器与 session 状态机见 "
"[Architecture](02-architecture.md)。运营侧术语见 [Users Manual 第 1 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/foundations/introduction)。目录归属见"
" [Repository Map](04-repo-map.md)。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:9
#: b7e742f0f398492398a6446ed626ad68
msgid "Two layers"
msgstr "两层"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:12
#: 0ef8af9a4b2f4db0bbe2ee00132ed9ed
msgid ""
"**APR/FSPR** answers “how do I mutex, socket, and allocate portably on "
"Linux, macOS, and Windows?” **FreeSWITCH core** answers “how do I "
"represent a call, a codec, a module, and a media frame?”"
msgstr ""
"**APR/FSPR** 回答的是：如何在 Linux、macOS、Windows 上可移植地做 mutex、socket "
"和分配。**FreeSWITCH Core** 回答的是：如何表达一次呼叫、一个 codec、一个 module、一帧媒体。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:15
#: d6df5c0069df4583b2cec37721bbf64b
msgid ""
"`FreeSWITCH = C + APR` understates the project. Treat core as a "
"telephony-oriented runtime on top of FSPR."
msgstr "`FreeSWITCH = C + APR` 会低估这个项目。应把 Core 看成架在 FSPR 之上、面向电话/实时通信的 runtime。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:18
#: 05d0c38d83f541d1973ae6292ac1a0b7
msgid "Layering"
msgstr "分层"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:39
#: 774eab0bce1c472591981309789565f6
msgid ""
"Public umbrella header: `src/include/switch.h`. Portability wrappers: "
"`src/include/switch_apr.h` implemented in `src/switch_apr.c` (calls "
"`fspr_*`, not raw `pthread_*` / BSD sockets). Telephony objects: "
"`src/include/switch_core.h`, `switch_channel.h`, `switch_event.h`, "
"`switch_frame.h`, `switch_rtp.h`, `switch_loadable_module.h`."
msgstr ""
"对外总头文件：`src/include/switch.h`。可移植封装：`src/include/switch_apr.h`，实现于 "
"`src/switch_apr.c`（调用 `fspr_*`，而不是直接 `pthread_*` / BSD "
"socket）。电话对象：`src/include/switch_core.h`、`switch_channel.h`、`switch_event.h`、`switch_frame.h`、`switch_rtp.h`、`switch_loadable_module.h`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:41
#: 756d1d668892436da578bb83248f0e3f
msgid ""
"There is **no** `switch_thread.h` / `switch_mutex.h` / `switch_queue.h` /"
" `switch_socket.h`. Those types live in `switch_apr.h`."
msgstr ""
"**没有**单独的 `switch_thread.h` / `switch_mutex.h` / `switch_queue.h` / "
"`switch_socket.h`。这些类型都在 `switch_apr.h` 里。"

