#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:71
#: 70dc101117494bb696cfac6704ef7c6f
msgid ""
"The design goal is: **modules and objects should not each invent their "
"own resource lifetime.** Pools, mutexes, sockets, and threads are tied to"
" a pool. Destroying the pool releases the allocations created from it."
msgstr ""
"设计目标是：**不要让每个模块、每个对象各自发明一套底层资源生命周期。** mutex、socket、thread 都挂在 pool 上；销毁 "
"pool 会释放从它分配出去的内存。"

