#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:169
#: 34f68ffde4154ace9916afdb7a8d404b
msgid ""
"FreeSWITCH: **which lifetime does this object belong to?** Session pool, "
"channel (via session), module/profile pool, listener pool, core permanent"
" pool (`switch_core_permanent_alloc`). When that lifetime ends, destroy "
"the pool."
msgstr ""
"FreeSWITCH：**这个对象属于哪个生命周期？** session pool、channel（经由 "
"session）、module/profile pool、listener pool、core 永久 "
"pool（`switch_core_permanent_alloc`）。生命周期结束就销毁对应 pool。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:171
#: 71189a06332f4e20a19c1c537d2e7083
msgid "7. Concurrency is not one-connection-one-thread"
msgstr "7. 并发不是简单地“一个连接一个线程”"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:173
#: 028371bded27412197075dce4bf1eacc
msgid ""
"A call mixes SIP signaling, channel state, RTP, codecs, applications, "
"events, and timers. Core uses threads, mutexes, rwlocks, condvars, "
"queues, and the event bus — not a single `pthread_create` per TCP "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"一次呼叫同时涉及 SIP 信令、channel 状态、RTP、codec、application、event 和 timer。Core 使用 "
"thread、mutex、rwlock、condvar、queue 和 event bus，而不是每个 TCP 连接一次 "
"`pthread_create`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:175
#: caa79facc8734d2f92dbe932f2fc4a94
msgid ""
"Session launch (`src/switch_core_session.c` "
"`switch_core_session_thread_launch`): if `SCF_SESSION_THREAD_POOL` is "
"set, it uses `switch_core_session_thread_pool_launch`; otherwise it "
"`switch_thread_create`s a detached thread on the session pool."
msgstr ""
"启动 session 线程（`src/switch_core_session.c` 的 "
"`switch_core_session_thread_launch`）：若设置了 `SCF_SESSION_THREAD_POOL`，走 "
"`switch_core_session_thread_pool_launch`；否则在 session pool 上 "
"`switch_thread_create` 一个 detached thread。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:177
#: 7a5efc2790894e01881146adbd55c630
msgid ""
"`SCF_SESSION_THREAD_POOL` is **set by default** in `switch_core_init` "
"(`src/switch_core.c`). XML `switch.conf` param `session-thread-pool` can "
"set or clear the flag. Vanilla "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/switch.conf.xml` does **not** currently "
"list that param; the default core flag still applies."
msgstr ""
"`SCF_SESSION_THREAD_POOL` 在 "
"`switch_core_init`（`src/switch_core.c`）里**默认打开**。XML `switch.conf` 参数 "
"`session-thread-pool` 可以打开或关闭。Vanilla "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/switch.conf.xml` **当前没有**写出该参数；核心默认标志仍然生效。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:179
#: 7247c9a954714d41b1794bbe26feac4c
msgid ""
"Event fan-out uses dispatch threads in `src/switch_event.c` "
"(`switch_event_dispatch_thread`, `EVENT_DISPATCH_QUEUE_THREADS`)."
msgstr ""
"事件分发使用 `src/switch_event.c` 中的 dispatch "
"线程（`switch_event_dispatch_thread`、`EVENT_DISPATCH_QUEUE_THREADS`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md:181
